bin/

# GoReleaser build output.
dist/

# CI puts GOPATH inside the project dir for caching.
.gopath/

# A bare `go build ./cmd/sparkflow-agentd` writes the binary HERE, at the repo root,
# where /bin/ and /dist/ rules do not look. Anchored on purpose: a bare
# `sparkflow-agentd` would also ignore the source dir of the same name
# (cmd/sparkflow-agentd). See docs CLAUDE.md, TENANCY-030, WIKI-230.
/sparkflow-agentd
